+```text
+∫₀^U (M − u)^a ∏_{q ∈ λ} (P̂_q + u^q) du = Σ_{T ⊆ λ} P̂_{λ∖T} Σ_{j ≤ a} C(a, j) (−1)^j M^{a−j} U^{s_T+j+1} / (s_T+j+1)
