+**Costs (measured).**
+- Kernel cost per moment grows roughly linearly in `m + n`: 3.7 s `(2, 0)`; 6–7 s `(2, 1)`, `(3, 0)`;
+  9–11 s `(2, 2)`, `(3, 1)`; 12–13 s `(4, 1)`, `(5, 0)`. Profiling places it in large-rational
